  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Response to COVID-19 in Advancing the National Educational Broadcasting System to Ensure the Continuity of Learning in Basic Science Education for All in Timor-Leste</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As a post-project of Cycle 3 of Basic Education for Mathematics and Science in Timor-Leste (526TIM1000 from 14 February 2014 to 30 May, 2018) to support Timor-Leste Ministry of Education, Youth, and Sport (TL-MoEYS), this project supports Basic Education School-aged children during and post- COVID-19 for their continuity of learning Science through the National Educational Broadcasting System (EBS) enabling them to access to Free and Quality Education covering all 13 Districts across the country.</narrative>
  </description>
